id\":\"nm0498212\",\"nameText\":{\"text\":\"Sang-il Lee\",\"__typename\":\"NameText\"},\"__typename\":\"Name\"},\"__typename\":\"CreditV2\"}],\"__typename\":\"PrincipalCreditsForGrouping\"}],\"production\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"company\":{\"id\":\"co0028938\",\"companyText\":{\"text\":\"Amuse\",\"__typename\":\"CompanyText\"},\"__typename\":\"Company\"},\"__typename\":\"CompanyCredit\"},\"__typename\":\"CompanyCreditEdge\"},{\"node\":{\"company\":{\"id\":\"co0132285\",\"companyText\":{\"text\":\"Aniplex\",\"__typename\":\"CompanyText\"},\"__typename\":\"Company\"},\"__typename\":\"CompanyCredit\"},\"__typename\":\"CompanyCreditEdge\"},{\"node\":{\"company\":{\"id\":\"co0606101\",\"companyText\":{\"text\":\"Asahi Shimbun Publications\",\"__typename\":\"CompanyText\"},\"__typename\":\"Company\"},\"__typename\":\"CompanyCredit\"},\"__typename\":\"CompanyCreditEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"CompanyCreditConnection\"},\"featuredReviews\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"author\":{\"nickName\":\"flcntk3-856-986017\",\"__typename\":\"UserProfile\"},\"summary\":{\"originalText\":\"National Treasure\",\"__typename\":\"ReviewSummary\"},\"text\":{\"originalText\":{\"plainText\":\"For a person who doesn't know one iota of the art of Kabuki nor any Japanese for that matter, I was mesmerized and engrossed for three hours by KOKUHO, which is a life story about a boy who was taken into the renown Kabuki house of Kamigata, and trained there along with the son of the house owner and master of the craft in the art of Kabuki. Through trial and tribulation of life, he rode the highs and lows of success and misfortune, with tradition and bloodline legacy as obstacles that broke the bond of brotherhood, but which also helped to rejoin that kinship of his later. This boy Kikuo, who is now a man, and because of his talents and devotion to the art, has finally become a \\\"Kokuho\\\", a National Treasure. This is a human story on an epic scale based on a novel by Shuichi Yoshida. The beauty of the film is in the elegance of its storytelling. The distillation of something down to its essence and extract the purity of its beauty is a unique form of Japanese aesthetics. This film has done that masterfully. And you can find that in the unadorned, yet beautifully framed tight camera works. Or in the explosive magic that comes from the formality of the theatrics of Kabuki. However, there is one thing I must mention, and which might have passed unnoticed because it works under the epidermis of consciousness of most and that is the music scoring. The music scoring is sublime. As an example of its power, the music for the scene where Kikuo took to the stage by anointment circumventing the protocol of legitimacy and thus replaced the son and heir to the role he took. The music for that scene underscored the disappointment and the heartbreak of the characters and its subtle power had moved me so very, very deeply. In closing, as I was leaving the theatre, I took one more look at the poster: \\\"KOKUHO\\\" (National Treasure). Yes, the story is about a boy maturing into an artist and becoming a National Treasure, but what is the true National Treasure? The man because of his artistry is only an embodiment of that. In thinking more deeply, I think the true \\\"National Treasure\\\" is the art form itself. It is the tradition, the culture and the essence of the art of Kabuki.\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"__typename\":\"ReviewText\"},\"authorRating\":10,\"submissionDate\":\"2025-10-25\",\"__typename\":\"Review\"},\"__typename\":\"ReviewEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"ReviewsConnection\"},\"__typename\":\"Title\"},\"mainColumnData\":{\"id\":\"tt35231039\",\"wins\":{\"total\":8,\"__typename\":\"AwardNominationConnection\"},\"nominationsExcludeWins\":{\"total\":27,\"__typename\":\"AwardNominationConnection\"},\"prestigiousAwardSummary\":{\"nominations\":1,\"wins\":0,\"award\":{\"text\":\"Oscar\",\"id\":\"aw0000016\",\"event\":{\"id\":\"ev0000003\",\"__typename\":\"AwardsEvent\"},\"__typename\":\"AwardDetails\"},\"__typename\":\"PrestigiousAwardSummary\"},\"ratingsSummary\":{\"topRanking\":null,\"__typename\":\"RatingsSummary\",\"aggregateRating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":4269,\"notificationText\":null},\"episodes\":null,\"videos\":{\"total\":1,\"__typename\":\"TitleRelatedVideosConnection\"},\"videoStrip\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"id\":\"vi1886898201\",\"contentType\":{\"displayName\":{\"value\":\"Trailer\",\"__typename\":\"LocalizedString\"},\"__typename\":\"VideoContentType\"},\"name\":{\"value\":\"Official Trailer\",\"__typename\":\"LocalizedString\"},\"runtime\":{\"value\":91,\"__typename\":\"VideoRuntime\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOTFmN2Y3NWItMjAzYi00YTBlLWJhOGItZTFkMTE0MGE1YmIxXkEyXkFqcGdeQXNvbG5vbXM@._V1_.jpg\",\"width\":1920,\"__typename\":\"Thumbnail\"},\"__typename\":\"Video\"},\"__typename\":\"VideoEdge\"}],\"__typename\":\"VideoConnection\"},\"titleMainImages\":{\"total\":71,\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"id\":\"rm3287274242\",\"url\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNWRjOWFlY2EtYmVmNC00OWY0LThiNzUtMTE0YTNiZjg3YjNiXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg\",\"caption\":{\"plainText\":\"Kokuho (2025)\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"height\":1080,\"width\":763,\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"__typename\":\"ImageEdge\"},{\"node\":{\"id\":\"rm3581139458\",\"url\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BOWY3NGNhOTUtNDI4Ny00MzRiLWJhMTctZDYzNTY3NTU1NTkwXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg\",\"caption\":{\"plainText\":\"Kokuho (2025)\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"height\":826,\"width\":570,\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"__typename\":\"ImageEdge\"},{\"node\":{\"id\":\"rm1978838530\",\"url\":\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BN2RmYjdmYjUtZTM1My00ZjM1LWJkOWItODAwNDk4MDkzMDMxXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg\",\"caption\":{\"plainText\":\"Kokuho (2025)\",\"__typename\":\"Markdown\"},\"height\":1500,\"width\":1000,\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"__typename\":\"ImageEdge\"},{\"node\":{\"id\":\"rm2549919234\",\"url\":\"https://m.media-ama